      "slice": "AttendanceHistory",
      "description": "An employee's own attendance history - one row per clock in, with the matching clock out when there is one, plus the hours worked. Scoped to the signed-in employee and filtered to one month, so the page can show the current month's total. A row with no clockedOutAt is a still-open or forgotten clock out.",
